WEBVTT

00:01.630 --> 00:03.570
An elite boy's school.

00:03.730 --> 00:06.570
I transferred after the semester began.

00:06.740 --> 00:09.570
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:09.710 --> 00:12.470
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:12.570 --> 00:13.840
...but why do I see a girl?

00:13.980 --> 00:15.070
I'm a guy!

00:15.180 --> 00:15.740
Huh?

00:15.840 --> 00:17.040
But that skirt...

00:17.150 --> 00:19.110
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:19.210 --> 00:19.700
What?

00:19.820 --> 00:22.050
The three of us are in this together.

00:22.150 --> 00:23.850
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:23.950 --> 00:25.550
No!

00:25.720 --> 00:29.560
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.530 --> 00:37.160
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:37.300 --> 00:43.900
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:49.870
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:50.010 --> 00:56.580
<i>I always have them</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.550 --> 01:02.250
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.490 --> 01:07.930
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:10.230 --> 01:15.900
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:16.000 --> 01:22.810
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like the wind.</i>

01:22.950 --> 01:29.610
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.720 --> 01:35.420
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.620 --> 01:42.290
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say...</i>

01:42.430 --> 01:48.100
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.400 --> 01:58.400
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.720 --> 02:06.180
<i>Path chosen by the Princess</i>

02:12.530 --> 02:14.860
Wait Sayaka! Listen to me...

02:22.970 --> 02:23.770
Sayaka!

02:23.970 --> 02:25.370
Don't come any closer!

02:25.640 --> 02:28.410
You come closer and I'll jump!

02:38.620 --> 02:41.890
What do we do? She'll jump if we don't do something!

02:45.790 --> 02:46.780
Sayaka...

02:47.100 --> 02:48.260
I said don't come any closer!

02:48.460 --> 02:51.730
So it was you, Sayaka.

02:52.100 --> 02:54.000
Why did you do it?

02:54.100 --> 02:56.040
Stop hurting other people!

02:56.440 --> 02:58.240
It's all your fault!

02:58.610 --> 03:00.770
You think those other people are more important than me!

03:00.880 --> 03:02.900
You're supposed to be mine!

03:03.050 --> 03:04.380
Sayaka...

03:04.780 --> 03:07.980
Why is it that everyone's trying to take you away from me?

03:08.120 --> 03:09.710
It's not like that Sayaka!

03:09.950 --> 03:12.280
Anyway, just come over here...

03:11.490 --> 03:12.280
<i>No!</i>

03:12.420 --> 03:14.720
Why don't you leave that person then?

03:14.890 --> 03:17.450
Then come back home with me!

03:17.690 --> 03:18.590
That's...

03:18.690 --> 03:19.920
Unbelievable!

03:20.030 --> 03:21.460
I can't listen to this anymore!

03:21.630 --> 03:22.500
Hey Shihoudani!

03:22.830 --> 03:27.290
You're being fretful like a little kid by trying to force your feelings onto him!

03:27.400 --> 03:31.000
Did you ever stop to think about Tohru's feelings?

03:31.310 --> 03:32.170
Yujirou.

03:32.810 --> 03:37.470
He treated you well, like a real sister, but if that sister ends up hurting others...

03:37.750 --> 03:39.810
He thinks it's his fault.

03:39.920 --> 03:42.910
Did you even think about what Tohru had to go through?

03:44.650 --> 03:45.990
I'm sorry, Sayaka.

03:46.390 --> 03:48.520
I should've talked to you more.

03:48.820 --> 03:52.060
I can't think of you as being more than a sister to me.

03:52.230 --> 03:53.130
No!

03:53.230 --> 03:54.660
I won't accept that!

03:54.760 --> 03:58.560
If I can't be with you, then I'd rather die!

03:58.670 --> 03:59.260
Watch out!

04:04.970 --> 04:06.530
Don't say you're going to die that easily!

04:06.980 --> 04:08.410
Tohru...

04:08.640 --> 04:11.170
We'll never see each other again if you die.

04:11.280 --> 04:13.440
Do you want your parents to be sad?

04:27.560 --> 04:29.260
Let's play, brother.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.530
Yeah.

04:38.040 --> 04:39.600
I...

04:41.910 --> 04:42.540
Sayaka!

04:42.980 --> 04:43.950
<i>Tohru!</i>
Kouno!

04:53.160 --> 04:55.620
I guess we made it just in time.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.590
Tohru, are you okay?

04:59.290 --> 05:02.030
President Arisada? You too, Akira?

05:02.260 --> 05:03.320
This is...

05:03.470 --> 05:06.990
Mr. Sakamoto told me all about it, so we came as soon as we could.

05:07.240 --> 05:09.200
I'm glad our princess isn't injured.

05:09.470 --> 05:11.500
Kouno! Are you, okay?

05:11.640 --> 05:13.230
Are you okay, Tohru?

05:13.410 --> 05:16.070
Yeah, I'm okay!

05:18.910 --> 05:21.380
Thanks Akira, you saved me.

05:21.480 --> 05:23.850
Don't mention it, I'm glad you're okay.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.850
Is she ok?

05:27.260 --> 05:28.750
Sayaka...

05:29.090 --> 05:31.920
Why did you save me?

05:32.860 --> 05:34.760
I did such terrible things...

05:34.860 --> 05:38.360
But you're still my important sister.

05:44.340 --> 05:46.570
I thought it was destiny...

05:48.380 --> 05:51.840
I really liked you ever since I was little...

05:52.580 --> 05:54.950
So I made up my mind.

05:55.120 --> 05:58.850
That you and I are destined to be.

06:01.290 --> 06:04.560
But you wouldn't accept me...

06:05.160 --> 06:07.630
...and other people started approaching you...

06:07.730 --> 06:11.460
I couldn't accept that, and lost control of my emotions...

06:11.670 --> 06:13.160
It was painful...

06:16.300 --> 06:18.740
But now I understand.

06:18.970 --> 06:21.670
Even if I do these things, it wouldn't change anything...

06:21.810 --> 06:25.440
I'll just keep on getting farther apart from you...

06:25.550 --> 06:26.980
I don't hate you.

06:27.750 --> 06:30.650
You're an important part of my family...

06:34.590 --> 06:38.030
I'm sorry brother...

06:43.230 --> 06:45.200
I'm happy for you, Tohru.

06:45.330 --> 06:47.460
Yeah, thanks Akira.

06:47.870 --> 06:50.030
Thanks to Yujirou and Mikoto as well!

06:53.340 --> 06:55.170
Excuse me, Mr. Shihoudani.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.340
I'm sorry for giving you such a hard time.

06:57.710 --> 07:00.270
It's okay, I said something nasty to you too.

07:00.580 --> 07:03.920
Please look after Tohru from here on as well.

07:04.020 --> 07:05.510
I'll never get in your way again.

07:06.660 --> 07:08.020
Wait a minute, Sayaka!

07:08.120 --> 07:11.250
There's some sort of misunderstanding!
There's nothing between me and Yujirou!

07:11.360 --> 07:14.230
If we didn't act it out like that, you wouldn't have gone home...

07:14.400 --> 07:16.390
It was just role-playing...

07:16.500 --> 07:19.760
So, there's nothing between us!

07:26.470 --> 07:29.240
Well, problem solved.

07:29.880 --> 07:32.440
No one will bother you anymore.

07:32.550 --> 07:34.280
Don't worry about me.

07:34.520 --> 07:37.780
Tohru's the one we should be worried about.

07:38.350 --> 07:41.620
It's up to him to decide how he would start over with his family...

07:41.760 --> 07:43.160
I see...

07:43.960 --> 07:45.430
You're right.

07:45.760 --> 07:47.700
But I wouldn't worry about Kouno.

07:47.860 --> 07:50.260
I'm sure he can bounce back from this.

07:50.930 --> 07:52.700
But you're weak compared to him!

07:53.100 --> 07:54.000
What did you say?

07:54.140 --> 07:55.900
I'm really sorry.

07:56.100 --> 07:58.970
Sayaka is definitely reflecting back on what she did this time.

07:59.070 --> 08:03.100
No, it's my fault for not talking to her.

08:03.210 --> 08:05.200
I'm sure Sayaka will calm down after this.

08:05.310 --> 08:06.210
So...

08:06.310 --> 08:07.010
What?

08:13.520 --> 08:15.510
Are you done talking on the phone?

08:15.620 --> 08:18.020
Yeah, you can use the phone now.

08:18.130 --> 08:19.490
I'm going to make a call!

08:23.430 --> 08:27.100
I wonder what he talks about with his girlfriend everyday...

08:29.900 --> 08:31.370
What happened?

08:31.970 --> 08:33.240
Nothing.

08:33.710 --> 08:36.870
Sayaka went home, and everything is under control.

08:36.980 --> 08:37.780
Tohru!

09:04.770 --> 09:06.640
Good morning, Mr. Sakamoto!

09:06.740 --> 09:08.510
Mr. Sakamoto. Good morning!

09:08.640 --> 09:09.540
Good morning!

09:11.780 --> 09:14.180
Tohru! Yujirou! Good morning!

09:15.050 --> 09:17.140
Good morning Akira.

09:17.390 --> 09:20.080
What happened to you two?

09:22.360 --> 09:25.920
I'm sure Sayaka will calm down after this, so...

09:26.290 --> 09:28.530
Can you come home too?

09:28.730 --> 09:29.660
What?

09:29.930 --> 09:33.370
Somehow, we were depending on you.

09:33.500 --> 09:36.840
When I think how much we pushed you to the limit...

09:37.310 --> 09:40.800
Can you give us a chance?

09:40.940 --> 09:44.240
Let's start over as a family, Tohru...

09:49.850 --> 09:51.110
I see...

09:51.420 --> 09:53.950
That's what your uncle said...

09:54.160 --> 09:58.290
I was happy to know that he really cared about me...

09:58.590 --> 10:02.090
And, what are you going to do Tohru?

10:02.200 --> 10:04.360
Do you want to go back to your old school?

10:04.470 --> 10:07.800
I didn't hate my old school...

10:08.470 --> 10:10.940
But compared to here, it's totally different.

10:11.110 --> 10:13.970
Over there, I may have been laughing on the outside...

10:14.110 --> 10:17.010
...but I wasn't really enjoying myself.

10:17.210 --> 10:19.550
Somehow, I would've been satisfied by that...

10:20.050 --> 10:23.750
But after I came to this school,
I was able to laugh naturally.

10:24.250 --> 10:25.190
Tohru...

10:25.590 --> 10:29.120
They made me do this princess job out of nowhere, and ran into lots of problems.

10:29.220 --> 10:32.060
We ran around feeling angry and happy...

10:32.430 --> 10:34.400
But it's really fun.

10:34.760 --> 10:36.490
Since you guys are here...

10:54.580 --> 10:57.180
So I want to stay here.

10:57.320 --> 10:58.980
Then stay!

10:59.120 --> 11:02.090
Even if your uncle tells you to come home, you don't have to do what he says!

11:02.520 --> 11:05.720
But they're family to me.

11:08.260 --> 11:09.820
That's tough.

11:10.370 --> 11:13.340
You really care about your family...

11:13.570 --> 11:16.870
...so you want to do what your uncle says right?

11:18.640 --> 11:23.080
I think you have to think hard and decide what you want to do.

11:23.210 --> 11:24.270
Akira...

11:46.130 --> 11:48.540
But to tell you the truth...

11:48.640 --> 11:51.270
I want you to stay here Tohru.

11:51.570 --> 11:56.530
You're an important friend to me, so if you leave, I'll probably feel very sad.

11:57.050 --> 11:58.170
Akira...

11:58.280 --> 12:00.150
You too, right, Yujirou?

12:00.250 --> 12:01.720
Even you, Yutaka...

12:01.820 --> 12:03.880
Does this mean he won't do the princess job?

12:03.990 --> 12:06.010
I won't allow it!

12:06.190 --> 12:08.420
It's not fair that you get to be excused!

12:08.720 --> 12:11.090
Mikoto will get mad and prevent him from leaving.

12:11.330 --> 12:12.260
Probably...

12:16.900 --> 12:19.730
Anyway, I'll think it over again.

12:19.870 --> 12:21.500
Yeah, okay.

12:21.840 --> 12:23.360
Let's go Yujirou.

12:26.010 --> 12:27.270
Yujirou!

12:29.680 --> 12:31.340
Don't say anything to Mikoto!

12:31.510 --> 12:33.140
He might make things complicated for us!

12:33.280 --> 12:34.340
Got it.

12:34.620 --> 12:35.880
Roger.

12:38.620 --> 12:42.560
I have a very bad feeling about this...

12:42.820 --> 12:44.160
Are you serious?

12:44.260 --> 12:46.350
Yeah, that's what I heard them say.

12:47.100 --> 12:48.830
Princess Tohru is leaving this school!

12:48.930 --> 12:49.920
That can't be!

12:50.030 --> 12:51.060
We have to tell everyone!

12:51.170 --> 12:54.070
<i>Student association room</i>

12:54.770 --> 12:56.670
Now take a look at these documents.

12:56.770 --> 12:57.430
Yeah...

12:57.540 --> 12:59.170
Arisada, it's an emergency!

13:02.210 --> 13:03.510
What should I do?

13:03.680 --> 13:08.080
I want to stay here, but I don't want to disappoint my family.

13:08.350 --> 13:12.050
I don't want to cause any trouble, maybe
I should just do what they wish...

13:12.790 --> 13:14.980
I don't have the right to tell you what to do...

13:15.190 --> 13:19.060
But I'm glad I was able to talk with my family.

13:19.330 --> 13:21.520
Even if you've been with your family for so long...

13:21.660 --> 13:24.830
...there are things that can only be told in words.

13:24.930 --> 13:29.500
And there are certain things you must say since they're important.

13:29.700 --> 13:34.540
Anyway, even though my sister and I fight a lot, we don't hate each other.

13:35.640 --> 13:39.550
I'm about to make the same mistake again.

13:39.710 --> 13:43.210
I was reserved and just thought about pleasing my family...

13:43.480 --> 13:46.610
And that's what destroyed my relationship with them.

13:49.560 --> 13:51.580
It's just like how it used to be...

13:52.930 --> 13:54.590
Things just can't be the same!

13:55.060 --> 13:56.590
Things have to change.

13:57.170 --> 13:58.930
I have to tackle the problem...

13:59.730 --> 14:00.670
Kouno!

14:00.870 --> 14:02.300
I heard about it Kouno!

14:02.770 --> 14:04.500
You're thinking of transferring?

14:04.610 --> 14:05.440
Mikoto...

14:05.540 --> 14:07.840
That means you won't be a princess anymore!

14:07.940 --> 14:10.280
I won't let you get away with this!

14:10.680 --> 14:12.770
Just as I thought.

14:13.310 --> 14:14.940
I mean, just think about it!

14:15.150 --> 14:19.110
If you leave, then Shihoudani and
I have to be the only princesses!

14:19.220 --> 14:21.590
If that happens, I...

14:21.720 --> 14:25.660
That Cinderella's sister Shihoudani is going to keep on teasing me!

14:27.700 --> 14:29.820
Do a good job Mikoto!

14:32.100 --> 14:33.730
No!

14:34.570 --> 14:35.430
Mikoto...

14:35.540 --> 14:39.370
I'll bet when you're gone, he's going to vent his feeling of bitterness against me!

14:39.670 --> 14:42.370
I didn't do anything wrong, but he's going to take it out on me!

14:42.480 --> 14:43.970
He's definitely that kind of person!

14:44.910 --> 14:46.070
And so...

14:46.210 --> 14:48.550
If you're not here, then I'll suffer!

14:48.650 --> 14:50.020
Yes, okay, okay.

14:50.120 --> 14:51.350
I'm sure you will...

14:51.450 --> 14:54.790
So, don't go, Kouno.

14:56.390 --> 14:58.420
We three make up the princesses.

14:58.560 --> 15:02.550
You and Shihoudani have to help me, since I'm always indecisive.

15:03.160 --> 15:04.500
Mikoto...

15:05.030 --> 15:09.400
I know what's going on with your family, but I want you to stay here with us.

15:09.970 --> 15:11.130
Yujirou, Akira!

15:11.240 --> 15:12.230
What are you looking at?

15:12.340 --> 15:13.100
What?

15:13.240 --> 15:14.540
You guys were listening?

15:14.640 --> 15:15.770
Everything.

15:15.880 --> 15:19.110
I see, so that's how you felt about me Mikoto...

15:20.420 --> 15:22.350
I told you not to say anything to Mikoto.

15:22.850 --> 15:24.320
I'm sorry, Tohru.

15:24.420 --> 15:28.150
We can't keep quiet about interesting things like this.

15:28.290 --> 15:31.020
Actually, we'll do anything to make you stay.

15:33.160 --> 15:34.690
Yujirou...

15:44.070 --> 15:45.330
I...

15:47.280 --> 15:48.770
Princess Tohru!

15:48.880 --> 15:51.470
<i>Don't go!</i>

15:52.410 --> 15:53.400
What's going on?

15:53.750 --> 15:56.680
Princess Tohru! Don't transfer!

15:56.780 --> 15:58.450
Princess Tohru! Don't leave us!

15:58.820 --> 16:01.590
We can't win without your cheers!

16:01.720 --> 16:04.390
We can't hit a homerun without you!

16:04.890 --> 16:05.950
This is...

16:06.060 --> 16:10.400
They gathered here immediately after they learned that you might transfer.

16:10.970 --> 16:12.060
President Arisada.

16:12.170 --> 16:15.000
You're not really thinking about transferring, right?

16:16.170 --> 16:18.500
That's impossible, Arisada.

16:18.610 --> 16:22.070
When he accepts a job, he always gets it done.

16:22.340 --> 16:25.970
That's right, he's a princess that the students really adore.

16:26.280 --> 16:29.680
By the way, we received an inquiry from director Ryuzaki.

16:29.850 --> 16:32.650
I'm sure there'll be an emergency board meeting.

16:32.920 --> 16:34.580
Word gets around very fast...

16:34.720 --> 16:37.620
Kouno, you're not really thinking about quitting the princess job, right?

16:37.730 --> 16:38.850
Natasho...

16:38.960 --> 16:39.980
You can't!

16:40.090 --> 16:42.000
You guys are the only ones that can wear my wardrobe!

16:42.100 --> 16:44.730
Those designs are balanced out so that it looks good on all three of you!

16:44.830 --> 16:46.560
It won't mean anything if one of you were to quit!

16:46.830 --> 16:49.500
My new wardrobe is about to be completed!

16:49.600 --> 16:52.040
It's coming, it's coming!
I'm getting new ideas!

16:52.040 --> 16:52.770
<i>It's coming, it's coming!</i>
<i>I'm getting new ideas!</i>

16:53.940 --> 16:57.710
Natasho only thinks about wardrobes.

16:57.850 --> 17:00.640
He goes all the way, I respect him.

17:00.750 --> 17:01.940
You're right...

17:02.180 --> 17:02.880
Take him away.

17:03.250 --> 17:06.310
That's enough Natasho!

17:04.120 --> 17:06.310
<i>But I'm not finished!</i>

17:06.590 --> 17:11.080
I think Natasho senpai really cares about you too, Tohru...

17:11.160 --> 17:12.990
Really?

18:34.210 --> 18:36.640
Can I say something selfish?

18:37.240 --> 18:38.870
Of course you can.

18:38.980 --> 18:39.810
I'll allow it.

18:40.280 --> 18:42.750
I want to spend more time with you guys!

18:55.830 --> 18:56.920
Everyone!

18:57.060 --> 18:58.330
I decided to stay here!

18:58.770 --> 19:00.500
I'm not going anywhere!

19:05.310 --> 19:08.210
<i>Several days later</i>

19:31.930 --> 19:34.830
<i>Home economics room</i>

20:01.730 --> 20:03.320
Just as I thought.

20:03.600 --> 20:06.070
It's just as I imagined!
Definitely ideal!

20:06.170 --> 20:09.430
These wardrobes were made with a fluffy lace and ribbon to make it lovely and...

20:09.570 --> 20:11.300
That's enough Natasho!

20:18.880 --> 20:20.210
Good job you guys!

20:20.580 --> 20:22.450
You have work for the student organization right?

20:22.820 --> 20:23.650
Good luck.

20:23.950 --> 20:25.350
Yeah, thanks.

20:25.620 --> 20:27.140
Well, good luck you guys.

20:27.620 --> 20:30.420
Good job Mr. Sakamoto! And good luck!

20:30.730 --> 20:31.590
Thank you very much.

20:31.930 --> 20:33.760
Akira is the same as usual...

20:34.060 --> 20:36.760
It really looks great when all three of them are together!

20:36.860 --> 20:38.420
Yeah, it's really satisfying!

20:38.630 --> 20:41.730
Well, let's go do our jobs today!

20:42.140 --> 20:44.400
First, we'll go and cheer for the baseball club.

20:44.610 --> 20:47.630
I really don't like wearing this...

20:47.980 --> 20:50.140
Mikoto, you should stop complaining.

20:50.310 --> 20:51.300
That's right.

20:51.410 --> 20:53.850
Everybody wants us.

20:53.950 --> 20:55.440
I know...

20:59.090 --> 21:00.420
By the way Yujirou.

21:00.520 --> 21:01.010
Hmm?

21:01.290 --> 21:03.990
What were you thinking back then?

21:04.260 --> 21:06.590
You didn't tell me how you felt.

21:12.500 --> 21:17.800
Of course I wanted you to stay here.

21:24.310 --> 21:26.510
Kouno! What are you doing?

21:26.610 --> 21:27.480
Hurry up!

21:27.820 --> 21:28.710
Okay!

21:29.680 --> 21:32.020
Now, let's do a good job today as well!

21:42.000 --> 21:49.560
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.670 --> 21:57.740
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:58.250 --> 22:05.620
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.690 --> 22:13.420
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.560 --> 22:23.560
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.800 --> 22:30.440
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.740 --> 22:32.270
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.380 --> 22:40.120
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:40.220 --> 22:46.250
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.360 --> 22:48.390
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.660 --> 22:58.660
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>
